Subject: [PATCH 58/98] fix(feishu): improve tool-only thinking panel layout
 and title

Move cumulative tool count into the panel title when no reasoning text
is present.  Keep the panel body rendered after the running label clears
to avoid flicker.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
